WEBVTT

00:00:02.470 --> 00:00:05.500
You who received the Revelation of Babel.

00:00:07.890 --> 00:00:13.510
You who will overcome many 
battles and trials...

00:00:15.730 --> 00:00:18.170
You who received the Revelation.

00:00:20.740 --> 00:00:23.560
You, unleashed from your prison,

00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:27.530
you who were stolen...

00:00:29.720 --> 00:00:32.300
Burning with a fervent desire...

00:00:35.320 --> 00:00:39.750
You who would challenge me.

00:00:41.330 --> 00:00:45.520
Yes, you, the Hand Shaker...

00:00:47.440 --> 00:00:50.230
<i>What the voice said was true.</i>

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.320
<i>Strangely, I was sure of it.</i>

00:02:39.410 --> 00:02:40.890
<i>Why?</i>

00:02:41.330 --> 00:02:43.760
<i>Why do I have to do this?</i>

00:02:45.350 --> 00:02:49.250
Tazuna-kun, if you let go of her hand,

00:02:49.250 --> 00:02:50.730
Koyori-kun will...

00:02:51.270 --> 00:02:52.720
I don't understand.

00:02:52.720 --> 00:02:53.270
No,

00:02:54.150 --> 00:02:57.530
even if I did understand, Makihara-sensei...

00:02:58.150 --> 00:03:00.400
But I don't understand!

00:03:00.400 --> 00:03:02.530
You must challenge it anyway!

00:03:02.530 --> 00:03:05.030
No! I don't want to!

00:03:06.290 --> 00:03:07.540
Tazuna-kun!

00:03:17.300 --> 00:03:19.420
If you don't hurry, she'll pee right there.

00:03:19.420 --> 00:03:22.300
What is a Hand Shaker?

00:03:26.290 --> 00:03:28.230
Thank you.

00:03:28.230 --> 00:03:30.890
None for you yet, Koyori-kun.

00:03:30.890 --> 00:03:33.050
You've been asleep for a long time,

00:03:33.050 --> 00:03:35.270
so we need to get you used 
to it little by little.

00:03:35.830 --> 00:03:37.880
I'm sure you have a lot of questions.

00:03:40.260 --> 00:03:41.020
Yeah.

00:03:41.400 --> 00:03:44.030
First, let me give you some good news.

00:03:44.030 --> 00:03:46.780
The Hand Shakers you defeated...

00:03:47.040 --> 00:03:50.290
Rei-kun! Rei-kun! Rei-kun!

00:03:50.720 --> 00:03:52.410
They're fine.

00:03:52.840 --> 00:03:56.540
I had them sent to the university hospital.

00:03:56.540 --> 00:03:59.420
Wounds received in the 
Ziggurat don't last long.

00:04:00.610 --> 00:04:05.180
The Ziggurat is that world with no one in it?

00:04:05.180 --> 00:04:06.540
That's right.

00:04:06.540 --> 00:04:07.930
Indeed!

00:04:07.930 --> 00:04:09.810
And I have to fight?

00:04:10.290 --> 00:04:11.740
With guys like that?

00:04:12.260 --> 00:04:13.190
Why?

00:04:13.880 --> 00:04:16.690
You heard the Revelation of Babel, right?

00:04:17.320 --> 00:04:19.960
So you should know what you must do.

00:04:19.960 --> 00:04:21.720
You were chosen, and your 
wish drives your will to fight

00:04:21.720 --> 00:04:23.950
so you can meet God.

00:04:23.950 --> 00:04:26.820
That's a Hand Shaker.

00:04:27.120 --> 00:04:29.100
I don't want that!

00:04:38.470 --> 00:04:42.480
I don't know if the voice 
you heard was actually God.

00:04:42.480 --> 00:04:44.600
Maybe it's a demon pretending to be God.

00:04:44.600 --> 00:04:47.120
Or perhaps it is power without will,

00:04:47.120 --> 00:04:49.720
created by the collective subconscious 
in its desire to meet God.

00:04:49.720 --> 00:04:51.470
You don't know?

00:04:51.810 --> 00:04:53.660
We don't know.

00:04:53.660 --> 00:04:56.430
And so finding that out is my job!

00:04:56.850 --> 00:05:00.200
The Ziggurat, the Nimrods, 
the Revelation of Babel,

00:05:00.200 --> 00:05:01.770
God, the Hand Shakers...

00:05:01.770 --> 00:05:04.780
I will be the one to explain them all!

00:05:04.780 --> 00:05:06.440
Me, Makihara Nagamasa!

00:05:06.440 --> 00:05:08.250
By the way, I'm an assistant professor.

00:05:08.250 --> 00:05:11.120
I may not be a Hand Shaker,

00:05:11.120 --> 00:05:14.430
but couldn't you say this is my battle?

00:05:14.430 --> 00:05:16.250
You sure you could!

00:05:20.040 --> 00:05:21.110
Ahem.

00:05:21.110 --> 00:05:24.410
Sometimes people tell me I'm annoying.

00:05:24.410 --> 00:05:27.260
But I think I'm just too cautious.

00:05:27.600 --> 00:05:29.260
That's a very optimistic interpretation...

00:05:31.140 --> 00:05:32.520
That's it!

00:05:32.520 --> 00:05:34.430
Optimistic! Positive!

00:05:34.430 --> 00:05:36.330
That's my philosophy in life.

00:05:36.330 --> 00:05:38.270
I love the belief that human 
nature is fundamentally good.

00:05:41.970 --> 00:05:43.910
Why not try a shumai?

00:05:45.080 --> 00:05:49.980
So basically, by holding each 
other's hands, you can gain power,

00:05:49.980 --> 00:05:53.660
a weapon called a Nimrod, and 
superhuman physical abilities.

00:05:53.660 --> 00:05:56.760
And then you fight in a parallel 
world called the Ziggurat.

00:05:56.760 --> 00:05:58.920
That's a Hand Shaker.

00:06:00.100 --> 00:06:02.890
There are only a few of 
them among the whole of humanity.

00:06:02.890 --> 00:06:05.340
They find each other and fight.

00:06:05.340 --> 00:06:08.570
And, someday, the one who wins will meet God

00:06:08.570 --> 00:06:10.920
and have their wish granted, or so it's said.

00:06:10.920 --> 00:06:12.640
No one knows when this fight started,

00:06:12.640 --> 00:06:15.680
or who grants the wish.

00:06:17.200 --> 00:06:19.980
That's the phenomenon I research.

00:06:20.340 --> 00:06:21.420
I don't want that.

00:06:21.420 --> 00:06:22.990
I don't want to fight.

00:06:22.990 --> 00:06:25.680
But whether you like it or not,

00:06:25.680 --> 00:06:28.240
the other Hand Shakers will come after you.

00:06:30.640 --> 00:06:32.470
Those Hand Shakers,

00:06:32.930 --> 00:06:35.950
the two with the chains... 
They lost their power, right?

00:06:35.950 --> 00:06:38.810
Seems like you do understand a little.

00:06:38.810 --> 00:06:42.480
Fatal wounds in the Ziggurat 
induce a form of pseudo-death

00:06:42.480 --> 00:06:45.140
and you end your life as a Hand Shaker.

00:06:46.280 --> 00:06:48.170
That's my interpretation.

00:06:48.170 --> 00:06:50.510
The fact is that if one is defeated,

00:06:50.510 --> 00:06:51.720
the pair loses their Nimrod

00:06:51.720 --> 00:06:54.220
and can no longer enter the Ziggurat.

00:06:54.870 --> 00:06:57.510
Then I'm just going to lose.

00:06:57.510 --> 00:06:59.600
If you really don't die, I don't care.

00:06:59.910 --> 00:07:02.910
It's true that you won't die,

00:07:02.910 --> 00:07:04.630
Takatsuki Tazuna-kun.

00:07:05.360 --> 00:07:06.490
You won't die.

00:07:13.190 --> 00:07:17.680
I'm sure you sensed this, 
but Hand Shakers have to use their power

00:07:17.680 --> 00:07:20.150
just to maintain their 
bodies inside the Ziggurat.

00:07:20.150 --> 00:07:22.620
And where does that power come from?

00:07:23.800 --> 00:07:25.880
Holding hands.

00:07:26.880 --> 00:07:29.010
I call it a charge.

00:07:29.010 --> 00:07:32.780
That's what lets a Hand 
Shaker create their Nimrod

00:07:32.780 --> 00:07:35.210
and stay in the Ziggurat.

00:07:35.210 --> 00:07:38.640
That also means that if you don't 
charge for long periods of time,

00:07:38.640 --> 00:07:41.660
you won't be able to stay in the Ziggurat.

00:07:41.660 --> 00:07:44.760
Well, if both enemies and 
allies lose their power,

00:07:44.760 --> 00:07:46.820
they both get bounced out.

00:07:47.910 --> 00:07:49.320
Normally.

00:07:50.760 --> 00:07:52.200
You don't mean...

00:07:52.610 --> 00:07:55.320
Koyori is different?

00:07:57.000 --> 00:07:58.410
That's right,

00:07:58.410 --> 00:08:00.140
Takatsuki Tazuna-kun.

00:08:00.960 --> 00:08:04.330
I told you, if you let go 
of her hand, she'll die.

00:08:04.620 --> 00:08:07.630
Of course, she won't die immediately.

00:08:07.630 --> 00:08:10.860
But someday she surely will.

00:08:11.960 --> 00:08:15.480
If you want to be positive about 
it, Koyori-kun is a special girl.

00:08:15.480 --> 00:08:19.370
For her, this world is the 
same as the Ziggurat.

00:08:20.710 --> 00:08:25.600
Just being here drains her of 
her power and her existence.

00:08:26.150 --> 00:08:27.550
If she doesn't charge,

00:08:27.550 --> 00:08:29.550
if she loses her power,

00:08:29.550 --> 00:08:32.260
she'll disappear from this world?

00:08:33.170 --> 00:08:35.740
You're her partner, so you can tell, right?

00:08:36.040 --> 00:08:38.620
That what I'm saying is the truth?

00:08:39.160 --> 00:08:40.240
Why?

00:08:40.240 --> 00:08:43.880
Finding that out is part of my job, as well.

00:08:44.720 --> 00:08:47.180
In order to keep Koyori-kun alive,

00:08:47.180 --> 00:08:50.580
I decided to put her to sleep 
until she found a partner.

00:08:51.200 --> 00:08:56.130
I hoped that while she was 
asleep we might find a cure.

00:08:57.170 --> 00:08:58.760
But you came!

00:08:58.760 --> 00:09:03.210
You being here saved Koyori-kun from

00:09:03.210 --> 00:09:05.000
slowly and surely wasting away!

00:09:08.530 --> 00:09:09.800
But...

00:09:09.800 --> 00:09:11.150
Why me?

00:09:11.860 --> 00:09:15.280
My job's to find that out, too.

00:09:15.780 --> 00:09:17.990
You have a lot of jobs, don't you?

00:09:20.770 --> 00:09:23.040
But what do I do?

00:09:24.740 --> 00:09:26.290
In other words...

00:09:27.010 --> 00:09:29.980
You and Koyori-kun can live together

00:09:29.980 --> 00:09:33.300
and hold hands.

00:09:35.380 --> 00:09:36.930
I can't do that!

00:09:37.190 --> 00:09:38.150
Why?

00:09:39.170 --> 00:09:40.510
Puberty?

00:09:40.510 --> 00:09:41.600
I understand!

00:09:41.600 --> 00:09:42.930
Not meshing!

00:09:48.720 --> 00:09:51.570
I have a family.

00:09:55.650 --> 00:09:58.410
I'm worried about you, not them.

00:09:58.410 --> 00:10:00.200
Your life's on the line,

00:10:00.200 --> 00:10:01.820
and I want to help you.

00:10:01.820 --> 00:10:02.440
But...

00:10:02.440 --> 00:10:03.660
Tazuna-kun.

00:10:04.340 --> 00:10:06.880
I'll take care of any 
problems with your parents.

00:10:06.880 --> 00:10:10.020
We grown-ups can do things like that.

00:10:10.440 --> 00:10:12.860
And that's our job.

00:10:14.320 --> 00:10:16.070
Makihara-sensei.

00:10:19.430 --> 00:10:20.680
<b>Koyori-chan</b>

00:10:19.430 --> 00:10:21.050
Welcome, Koyori-chan!

00:10:19.430 --> 00:10:21.050
Welcome, Koyori-kun!

00:10:21.050 --> 00:10:24.590
Don't girls look cute 
in their uniforms, honey?

00:10:24.590 --> 00:10:26.540
They sure do, honey!

00:10:29.080 --> 00:10:31.460
Is it okay for it to be this easy?

00:10:32.100 --> 00:10:33.320
How?

00:10:33.320 --> 00:10:35.640
What are you talking about Tazuna?

00:10:36.160 --> 00:10:38.320
Now sit down.

00:10:38.320 --> 00:10:40.220
That's right, Tazuna-chan.

00:10:41.330 --> 00:10:44.830
Koyori-chan, you must be tired 
after coming such a long way.

00:10:44.830 --> 00:10:47.960
Okay, Koyori-chan, sit down.

00:10:48.400 --> 00:10:49.290
That's right.

00:10:49.290 --> 00:10:51.130
You've had a long day, right?

00:10:51.130 --> 00:10:52.710
Let's all sit down.

00:10:57.960 --> 00:11:00.280
What kind of welcome is this?!

00:10:57.960 --> 00:11:00.470
<b>Koyori-chan!!</b>

00:11:02.850 --> 00:11:04.860
I'll be going then.

00:11:04.860 --> 00:11:07.600
Oh, here.

00:11:07.600 --> 00:11:10.190
Oh, how kind of you.

00:11:10.740 --> 00:11:14.060
I hope you'll keep taking 
such good care of Tazuna.

00:11:14.600 --> 00:11:18.220
Nah, he's a good student.

00:11:18.220 --> 00:11:20.070
It's a big help.

00:11:20.580 --> 00:11:24.490
Please take care of Koyori-kun for me.

00:11:29.280 --> 00:11:30.600
Bye!

00:11:30.600 --> 00:11:32.330
You're really leaving?

00:11:35.590 --> 00:11:37.840
It must be really hard for you, Koyori-chan.

00:11:38.280 --> 00:11:40.350
Coming here from Brazil 
for an exchange program...

00:11:40.350 --> 00:11:42.130
I heard you're a third generation 
Japanese immigrant.

00:11:42.680 --> 00:11:44.370
<i>Brazil?</i>

00:11:44.370 --> 00:11:45.820
Honey!

00:11:45.820 --> 00:11:48.640
Koyori-chan isn't used to Japanese yet.

00:11:49.750 --> 00:11:52.540
I'm sure it was really 
hard to come all this way.

00:11:52.980 --> 00:11:55.680
Sensei said you aren't 
used to Japanese food,

00:11:55.680 --> 00:11:59.400
so to let you get used to it little by little.

00:12:00.040 --> 00:12:03.020
So all we can give you is what he gave us, sorry.

00:12:03.020 --> 00:12:04.410
Honey,

00:12:04.410 --> 00:12:07.630
she's not used to Japanese yet?

00:12:07.630 --> 00:12:10.660
Aww, how silly of me!

00:12:10.660 --> 00:12:12.790
You're so goofy, honey!

00:12:13.420 --> 00:12:14.910
Aww, honey!

00:12:14.910 --> 00:12:16.250
Take this!

00:12:19.000 --> 00:12:21.420
You've got a guest. This is embarrassing.

00:12:23.520 --> 00:12:24.890
Anyway,

00:12:25.430 --> 00:12:28.860
you'll be staying here with us 
during your exchange program.

00:12:28.860 --> 00:12:31.930
Tazuna, look out for her.

00:12:35.200 --> 00:12:36.480
I know that.

00:12:37.640 --> 00:12:39.110
Dinner will get cold.

00:12:39.110 --> 00:12:40.480
Let's eat.

00:12:41.090 --> 00:12:42.490
Let's eat.

00:12:51.240 --> 00:12:53.340
You don't know how to eat?

00:12:57.860 --> 00:12:58.900
Like this.

00:13:20.460 --> 00:13:22.420
You're a fast learner.

00:13:27.750 --> 00:13:29.660
All I did was show her how.

00:13:30.040 --> 00:13:31.900
An indirect kiss!

00:13:31.900 --> 00:13:33.020
Honey!

00:13:33.020 --> 00:13:34.040
That's enough.

00:13:34.040 --> 00:13:36.520
Oh, whoops!

00:13:36.520 --> 00:13:39.040
Guys, leave me alone!

00:13:43.600 --> 00:13:45.420
I'm exhausted...

00:13:52.760 --> 00:13:55.430
The bath, um...

00:13:56.730 --> 00:13:59.500
I don't think...

00:14:06.880 --> 00:14:07.960
Just a moment.

00:14:07.960 --> 00:14:09.200
Just a moment!

00:14:13.520 --> 00:14:14.650
You okay?

00:14:22.980 --> 00:14:26.590
I'll turn this way, then!

00:14:35.720 --> 00:14:37.270
You're not going to take your clothes off?

00:14:43.880 --> 00:14:44.940
Okay.

00:14:44.940 --> 00:14:46.320
You're sure, right?

00:14:49.010 --> 00:14:51.320
<i>Does she really understand?</i>

00:15:00.140 --> 00:15:01.470
<i>This isn't what it looks like!</i>

00:15:01.470 --> 00:15:03.600
<i>This isn't what it looks like! 
Please believe me, officer!</i>

00:15:03.600 --> 00:15:05.320
<i>Officer, she propositioned me!</i>

00:15:05.320 --> 00:15:06.650
<i>No, I mean...</i>

00:15:06.650 --> 00:15:08.480
<i>I couldn't help it. It's an accident!</i>

00:15:08.480 --> 00:15:10.140
<i>But it's the only thing I could do!</i>

00:15:10.140 --> 00:15:11.100
<i>It meshes!</i>

00:15:11.100 --> 00:15:12.250
<i>I'm sure it meshes!</i>

00:15:12.250 --> 00:15:13.440
<i>I think so, but...</i>

00:15:13.440 --> 00:15:15.350
<i>No, officer, stop! Stop!</i>

00:15:15.350 --> 00:15:17.610
<i>Actually, just arrest me!</i>

00:15:23.240 --> 00:15:25.160
I'll get in the bath.

00:15:25.160 --> 00:15:26.920
You wash your body first.

00:15:33.010 --> 00:15:36.440
Y-You don't know how to do this either?

00:15:42.040 --> 00:15:44.410
Why don't you know any—

00:15:52.710 --> 00:15:53.690
Okay.

00:15:54.180 --> 00:15:56.040
I'll wash you without looking.

00:15:56.040 --> 00:15:57.060
Okay?

00:15:58.680 --> 00:16:01.850
You learned how to eat dinner quickly,

00:16:01.850 --> 00:16:03.190
so learn this, too, please.

00:16:05.620 --> 00:16:07.900
If you don't feel well I'll hold your hand,

00:16:07.900 --> 00:16:08.920
so tell me.

00:16:26.330 --> 00:16:27.610
<i>I can do it.</i>

00:16:27.610 --> 00:16:29.290
<i>I know I can do it!</i>

00:16:29.290 --> 00:16:30.350
<i>I have to do it.</i>

00:16:30.350 --> 00:16:31.480
<i>Do it!</i>

00:16:31.480 --> 00:16:32.410
<i>That's right.</i>

00:16:32.410 --> 00:16:33.640
<i>Now's the time!</i>

00:16:33.640 --> 00:16:36.970
<i>People tell me I get too focused on 
things and don't come back, but this meshes!</i>

00:16:36.970 --> 00:16:38.750
<i>I'm about to become a machine.</i>

00:16:38.750 --> 00:16:40.320
<i>A machine!</i>

00:16:40.320 --> 00:16:43.370
<i>A machine that cleans Koyori!</i>

00:16:49.960 --> 00:16:50.980
<i>Machine!</i>

00:16:55.440 --> 00:16:57.740
I-I'm done.

00:16:58.630 --> 00:17:00.240
W-Wait!

00:17:00.570 --> 00:17:01.930
If you look this way...

00:17:13.340 --> 00:17:17.660
But I'm a machine!

00:17:18.180 --> 00:17:19.910
They're getting along so well.

00:17:26.120 --> 00:17:28.180
Were you concentrating?

00:17:28.180 --> 00:17:29.500
You're wide-open.

00:17:30.550 --> 00:17:32.020
It's a bad habit of mine.

00:17:32.790 --> 00:17:34.360
A tissue! I need a tissue!

00:17:35.140 --> 00:17:36.080
Am I going to die?

00:17:36.080 --> 00:17:37.360
Am I going to die?

00:17:43.280 --> 00:17:44.750
Brings back memories, doesn't it?

00:17:45.020 --> 00:17:45.850
Yup.

00:17:51.060 --> 00:17:53.260
Why did this happen?

00:18:06.050 --> 00:18:07.980
<i>But I guess I don't have a choice.</i>

00:18:08.370 --> 00:18:11.480
<i>Even if I don't know the 
reason, I woke her up.</i>

00:18:12.050 --> 00:18:13.580
<i>I'll take responsibility</i>

00:18:13.580 --> 00:18:14.940
<i>and help her.</i>

00:18:16.690 --> 00:18:17.880
Hello.

00:18:17.880 --> 00:18:20.940
This is Akutagawa Koyori,
a transfer student from Brazil.

00:18:20.940 --> 00:18:22.030
Get along with her, okay?

00:18:22.640 --> 00:18:24.910
Why are you doing the greeting for her?

00:18:24.910 --> 00:18:26.770
Why are you holding her hand?

00:18:26.160 --> 00:18:27.580
Are you that type of guy?

00:18:26.770 --> 00:18:28.670
Koyori-chan's so cute!

00:18:29.300 --> 00:18:31.670
Are you dating her? You jerk!

00:18:33.890 --> 00:18:36.220
Wait, are you trying to show her off? What?

00:18:36.220 --> 00:18:38.300
I don't think it meshes either.

00:18:38.790 --> 00:18:41.020
But Koyori's very shy,

00:18:41.020 --> 00:18:43.210
and she still doesn't
understand Japanese well.

00:18:43.210 --> 00:18:44.250
So I'm doing it for her.

00:18:48.040 --> 00:18:49.560
I'm doing it for her!

00:18:52.090 --> 00:18:54.280
Just translate for me, then!

00:18:54.280 --> 00:18:55.900
Tell her I think her eyes are pretty!

00:18:55.900 --> 00:18:57.980
What's your relationship?

00:18:57.980 --> 00:18:59.650
Are you living together?

00:18:59.650 --> 00:19:01.030
Nice to meet you, Koyori-chan!

00:19:00.160 --> 00:19:01.030
Jeez!

00:19:01.370 --> 00:19:02.600
This way, Koyori!

00:19:02.600 --> 00:19:03.450
Wait!

00:19:03.450 --> 00:19:05.130
Are you guys really dating?

00:19:05.130 --> 00:19:06.660
No!

00:19:10.550 --> 00:19:12.580
I guess I can understand, though.

00:19:16.470 --> 00:19:18.360
We made it away from them.

00:19:18.360 --> 00:19:19.910
Those guys...

00:19:19.910 --> 00:19:21.180
Jeez...

00:19:22.840 --> 00:19:23.860
You okay?

00:19:27.270 --> 00:19:29.410
You were asleep for so long.

00:19:29.410 --> 00:19:30.780
Am I pushing you too hard?

00:19:30.780 --> 00:19:31.690
Sorry.

00:19:35.030 --> 00:19:36.140
Tazuna-kun!

00:19:37.940 --> 00:19:39.260
President Lily!

00:19:44.360 --> 00:19:45.830
I heard what happened.

00:19:46.180 --> 00:19:48.020
Looks like you've had a rough time.

00:19:48.500 --> 00:19:49.770
A bit, yeah.

00:19:50.560 --> 00:19:51.830
Hello.

00:19:52.180 --> 00:19:55.800
I'm Houjou Lily, Tazuna-kun's friend.

00:19:55.800 --> 00:19:58.300
Just call me Lily.

00:20:02.500 --> 00:20:03.260
Oh!

00:20:03.260 --> 00:20:06.440
She doesn't speak a lot 
of Japanese yet, right?

00:20:06.440 --> 00:20:07.600
I'm sorry.

00:20:08.290 --> 00:20:10.520
I'll help her. It's okay.

00:20:11.360 --> 00:20:13.230
Anyway, did you need something?

00:20:13.700 --> 00:20:15.940
It's my little brother's game.

00:20:16.600 --> 00:20:18.320
I dropped it...

00:20:19.880 --> 00:20:23.300
I think it's an external problem like before.

00:20:24.290 --> 00:20:25.370
I can't use both hands.

00:20:25.960 --> 00:20:27.150
Sorry.

00:20:27.150 --> 00:20:29.870
It may take just a little 
more time than usual.

00:20:30.170 --> 00:20:31.750
I guess you can't help it.

00:20:35.690 --> 00:20:37.870
The Lovers.

00:20:37.870 --> 00:20:40.040
Love... Bonds...

00:20:40.680 --> 00:20:41.770
Um...

00:20:41.770 --> 00:20:43.010
You two sure are close.

00:20:45.970 --> 00:20:48.110
It's not like that!

00:20:50.640 --> 00:20:52.520
Hello, we've been waiting for you.

00:20:53.110 --> 00:20:55.230
Thank you for coming.

00:20:55.230 --> 00:20:57.720
No, thank you.

00:20:59.770 --> 00:21:03.530
Thanks for sparing some of 
your valuable time for us.

00:21:05.030 --> 00:21:06.600
A student who's an intern?

00:21:07.220 --> 00:21:08.330
A middle school student?

00:21:08.820 --> 00:21:10.250
No...

00:21:10.250 --> 00:21:12.290
Don't "no" him!

00:21:12.800 --> 00:21:16.030
Why did you make a very 
boss-like face right now?

00:21:16.030 --> 00:21:18.240
Oops!

00:21:18.240 --> 00:21:20.620
Sorry I look like a boss!

00:21:20.620 --> 00:21:21.420
Jeez!

00:21:21.420 --> 00:21:22.940
Don't apologize!

00:21:28.080 --> 00:21:30.810
I'm Mitsudera Chizuru, with Centeotl.

00:21:31.510 --> 00:21:33.690
This is my subordinate, Azuma Hayate.

00:21:33.690 --> 00:21:36.310
Thanks for having us here today.

00:23:11.140 --> 00:23:14.000
<i>There was a harbinger of their meeting.</i>

00:23:14.000 --> 00:23:18.040
<i>A boss and her employee who live 
within the rules of society.</i>

00:23:18.040 --> 00:23:21.690
<i>They invite Tazuna and 
Koyori to a sweet meal.</i>

00:23:21.690 --> 00:23:25.840
<i>Is this friendship formed by chance? Or...?</i>

00:23:25.840 --> 00:23:28.940
<i>The crossing between those that 
hold hands creates sparks,</i>

00:23:28.940 --> 00:23:30.800
<i>which fall onto the city at night.</i>

00:23:31.170 --> 00:23:33.040
<i>Next time on Hand Shakers,</i>

00:23:33.040 --> 00:23:35.830
<i>Episode Three: Blade and Dagger.</i>

00:23:36.220 --> 00:23:39.670
<i>Tazuna, this is your 
destiny. It isn't a trap.</i>
